# Dreadhorde Arcanist (power 1): "Whenever this creature attacks, you may cast target instant or sorcery card with mana
# value less than or equal to this creature's power from your graveyard without paying its mana cost. If that spell would
# be put into your graveyard, exile it instead." Faithless Looting on turn 1 discards a Lightning Bolt (mana value 1, exactly
# at the limit) and a Lightning Strike (2, just past it). Bot2's Shock (1) is in Bot2's graveyard. On turn 5 the attack
# trigger refuses the Strike and Bot2's Shock and takes the Bolt; it is cast for no mana (all three Mountains stay
# untapped) and, resolving, is exiled rather than put into the graveyard. Trample is checked on the attacker.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Faithless Looting
Dreadhorde Arcanist
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Strike
Mountain
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
